OL,3,GNEWSA60 years on: The Aberfan disaster
OL,4,Athrough the eyes of those who survived
OL,5,
OL,6,F60 years on: The Aberfan disaster
OL,7,Fthrough the eyes of those who survived
OL,9,FFew events have left a deeper mark on
OL,10,FWales than the Aberfan disaster.
OL,12,FSixty years on, the tragedy remains
OL,13,Fwoven into the nation's collective
OL,14,Fmemory, a day of unimaginable loss that
OL,15,Freshaped a community and changed
OL,16,Fattitudes to industrial safety across
OL,17,FBritain.
OL,19,FAt 09:15 on 21 October 1966, an
OL,20,Fordinary school morning was shattered
OL,21,Fwhen a coal tip above Aberfan
OL,22,Fcollapsed.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
